---
name: fix-complete
version: 2.0.0
description: Developer completion report for one finding bead (fix-task); the body of `atm task close <task-id> completed`. The lead reads `commit` and `rebased_onto` for the fix's sanity check and link.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - generated_at
  - task_id
  - sprint
  - branch
  - commit
  - rebased_onto
  - outcome
  - resolution_md
  - validation_md
optional_variables:
  - notes_md
defaults:
  notes_md: ""
metadata:
  type: fix-complete
  tags:
    - stage:fix
    - orchestration:beads
  workflow:
    scope:
      kind: sprint
      variable: sprint
    state: fix-complete
    stage: fix
    transition: complete
---
{% if outcome not in ["fixed", "not_reproducible"] %}{{ outcome | outcome_must_be_fixed_or_not_reproducible }}ERROR: outcome must be fixed or not_reproducible, got {{ outcome }}
{% endif %}# Fix Complete

Generated: {{ generated_at }}
Finding bead: {{ task_id }} (sprint {{ sprint }})
Branch: `{{ branch }}`
Commit: `{{ commit }}`
Rebased onto: `{{ rebased_onto }}`
Outcome: **{{ outcome }}**

## Machine Status (JSON)
```json
{
  "task": {{ task_id | tojson }},
  "sprint": {{ sprint | tojson }},
  "branch": {{ branch | tojson }},
  "commit": {{ commit | tojson }},
  "rebased_onto": {{ rebased_onto | tojson }},
  "outcome": {{ outcome | tojson }}
}
```

## Resolution
{{ resolution_md }}

## Validation
{{ validation_md }}
{% if notes_md %}
## Notes
{{ notes_md }}
{% endif %}
